{"3733130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Piecekeeper", "steam_appid": 3733130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/4026bc972f74ba0ecd90f1e40fbb5fc9.poster.avif?t=1787788505\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/4026bc972f74ba0ecd90f1e40fbb5fc9.webm?t=1787788505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/4026bc972f74ba0ecd90f1e40fbb5fc9.mp4?t=1787788505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i><strong>Piecekeeper</strong></i>, a roguelike deckbuilder in which you use enchanted chess pieces to resolve matters with a level of force normally considered unnecessary, but things these days have gotten <i>somewhat out of hand</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by genre classics like <strong><i>Slay the Spire</i></strong> and <strong><i>Monster Train</i></strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/6d0bcb42de75b1f32b53270ed1ac7fec.poster.avif?t=1787788505\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/6d0bcb42de75b1f32b53270ed1ac7fec.webm?t=1787788505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/6d0bcb42de75b1f32b53270ed1ac7fec.mp4?t=1787788505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a primary <strong><i>Order</i></strong> to shape your strategy, then form unlikely alliances with other <strong><i>Orders</i></strong> to discover wonderfully unfair combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you embrace the sacrificial flames of the <strong>Emberlight Order</strong>? Tamper irresponsibly with time alongside the <strong>Order of Timeliness</strong>? Compose improbable melodies with the <strong>Order of the Chorus</strong>? Or flirt, unwisely, with death in the <strong>Order of Necromance</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/ec23508a22284a400f4be1e8fb12916a.poster.avif?t=1787788505\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/ec23508a22284a400f4be1e8fb12916a.webm?t=1787788505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/ec23508a22284a400f4be1e8fb12916a.mp4?t=1787788505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you’ll uncover <strong>relics</strong> capable of transforming your strategy in powerful, irresponsible, and occasionally legally dubious ways. Some are mighty treasures of ancient importance. <i>Others</i> <i>appear to be things someone left behind in a village raffle.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/ddb4006f2e69f1c67b2ea5ee165fe4ef.poster.avif?t=1787788505\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/ddb4006f2e69f1c67b2ea5ee165fe4ef.webm?t=1787788505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/ddb4006f2e69f1c67b2ea5ee165fe4ef.mp4?t=1787788505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through a world of peculiar beasts, hostile oddities, cursed aristocrats, woodland nuisances, and other weird little fellows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemies are dangerous. Some are merely a tad upsetting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming in 2027:</strong> A strange little world of tactical battles, perilous choices, and very questionable creatures awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Piecekeeper now!</strong> <strong><i>(if you would be so kind).</i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/4026bc972f74ba0ecd90f1e40fbb5fc9.poster.avif?t=1787788505\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/4026bc972f74ba0ecd90f1e40fbb5fc9.webm?t=1787788505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/4026bc972f74ba0ecd90f1e40fbb5fc9.mp4?t=1787788505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i><strong>Piecekeeper</strong></i>, a roguelike deckbuilder in which you use enchanted chess pieces to resolve matters with a level of force normally considered unnecessary, but things these days have gotten <i>somewhat out of hand</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by genre classics like <strong><i>Slay the Spire</i></strong> and <strong><i>Monster Train</i></strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/6d0bcb42de75b1f32b53270ed1ac7fec.poster.avif?t=1787788505\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/6d0bcb42de75b1f32b53270ed1ac7fec.webm?t=1787788505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/6d0bcb42de75b1f32b53270ed1ac7fec.mp4?t=1787788505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a primary <strong><i>Order</i></strong> to shape your strategy, then form unlikely alliances with other <strong><i>Orders</i></strong> to discover wonderfully unfair combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you embrace the sacrificial flames of the <strong>Emberlight Order</strong>? Tamper irresponsibly with time alongside the <strong>Order of Timeliness</strong>? Compose improbable melodies with the <strong>Order of the Chorus</strong>? Or flirt, unwisely, with death in the <strong>Order of Necromance</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/ec23508a22284a400f4be1e8fb12916a.poster.avif?t=1787788505\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/ec23508a22284a400f4be1e8fb12916a.webm?t=1787788505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/ec23508a22284a400f4be1e8fb12916a.mp4?t=1787788505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you’ll uncover <strong>relics</strong> capable of transforming your strategy in powerful, irresponsible, and occasionally legally dubious ways. Some are mighty treasures of ancient importance. <i>Others</i> <i>appear to be things someone left behind in a village raffle.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/ddb4006f2e69f1c67b2ea5ee165fe4ef.poster.avif?t=1787788505\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/ddb4006f2e69f1c67b2ea5ee165fe4ef.webm?t=1787788505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/extras/ddb4006f2e69f1c67b2ea5ee165fe4ef.mp4?t=1787788505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through a world of peculiar beasts, hostile oddities, cursed aristocrats, woodland nuisances, and other weird little fellows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemies are dangerous. Some are merely a tad upsetting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming in 2027:</strong> A strange little world of tactical battles, perilous choices, and very questionable creatures awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Piecekeeper now!</strong> <strong><i>(if you would be so kind).</i></strong></p>", "short_description": "Draft cards, build synergies, and battle through a whimsical and fun roguelike deckbuilder where combining factions creates endlessly replayable experiences.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/145a53c5e16be893cf801847214ae9302572fc2a/header.jpg?t=1787788505", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/420461a726cb75a7750d14cced739195e235ab37/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787788505", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733130/420461a726cb75a7750d14cced739195e235ab37/capsule_184x6